WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.400
They could take your AI away.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.500
What if more of that power
belonged to us?

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.100
Our vision for AIPSTER is simple.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.700
Your computers in a personal mesh,

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.750
connected to other people's meshes,

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.100
sharing compute and GPUs.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.000
More control over the intelligence
we depend on.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.200
Don't let the data centers be the only
ones that have the power to compute.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.250
AI is for everyone.
